sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Authorized customer
    participant A as API
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant E as ESP32
    participant L as Lock driver
    Note over U,L: Proposed only; no device endpoints or firmware implemented
    U->>A: Request unlock with customer access credential
    A->>P: Verify entitlement, time window, locker and mapping
    alt Access denied
        A-->>U: Reject request
    else Access allowed
        A->>P: Persist expiring command ID
        A-->>U: 202 command ID (pending)
        E->>A: Poll using device credential
        A->>P: Revalidate queued command eligibility
        A-->>E: Command or 204 if none valid
        E->>E: Validate target, time, duration and durable journal
        alt Expired, invalid or duplicate
            E->>A: Rejection or previously saved result; no pulse
        else New valid command
            E->>E: Persist consumption before actuation
            E->>L: Bounded output pulse
            E->>L: Output inactive at local deadline
            E->>E: Persist output result and optional door observation
            E->>A: Idempotent terminal result
            A->>P: Record result (not proof of latch state)
        end
    end
    Note over A,E: Lost acknowledgements reuse ID; never automatically repeat pulse
    Note over E,L: Reboot with incomplete execution means UNKNOWN; no replay
